sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户
    participant View as LoginView
    participant Adapter as 生成 Projection + 平台连接
    participant Runtime as Login FeatureStore
    participant Reducer as FeatureStore.Reduce
    participant Runner as FeatureStore.ExecuteAsync
    participant Auth as IAuthService

    User->>View: 输入用户名与密码
    View->>Adapter: 平台绑定回写
    Adapter->>Runtime: InputIntent
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, intent)
        Reducer-->>Runtime: RuntimeSnapshot(nextState, operations, version)
        Runtime->>Runtime: 原子提交 RuntimeSnapshot 与 Version
    end
    Runtime-->>Adapter: 直接调度字段投影
    Adapter-->>View: View = f(State)

    User->>View: 点击登录
    View->>Adapter: 生成 Submit 命令
    Adapter->>Runtime: OperationStartIntent
    critical CommitGate
        Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, StartOperation)
        alt 当前状态通过启动验证
            Reducer-->>Runtime: OperationReduction(RunningSnapshot, [SubmitEffect], Accepted)
            Runtime->>Runtime: 原子提交操作身份、Running 与 Version
        else 启动验证拒绝
            Reducer-->>Runtime: OperationReduction(RejectedSnapshot, [], Rejected)
            Runtime->>Runtime: 提交本次验证反馈与 Version，不生成执行 Effect
        end
    end

    alt 操作已接纳
        Runtime-->>Adapter: 调度 Running 投影
        Adapter-->>View: 展示加载状态
        Runtime->>Runner: 执行 SubmitEffect(inputSnapshot, operationId)
        Note over Runtime,Auth: IO 在 CommitGate 外执行；输入仍可继续提交
        Runner->>Auth: LoginAsync(inputSnapshot, cancellationToken)
        Auth-->>Runner: AuthResult
        Runner->>Runtime: UpdateAsync 转换为 ApplyLoginResult 内部 Intent
        critical CommitGate
            Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, resultIntent)
            Reducer->>Reducer: 核对操作有效性并应用纯转换
            Reducer-->>Runtime: RuntimeSnapshot(nextState, operations, version)
            Runtime->>Runtime: 基于当前业务状态提交结果与 Version
        end
        Runtime-->>Runner: UpdateAsync 的状态提交完成
        Runner->>Runtime: OperationCompleted 内部 Intent
        critical CommitGate
            Runtime->>Reducer: Reduce(currentSnapshot, completionIntent)
            Reducer-->>Runtime: OperationReduction(CompletedSnapshot, [], Accepted)
            Runtime->>Runtime: 原子提交 OperationStates 与 Version
        end
        Runtime-->>Adapter: 调度最新统一快照投影
        Runtime-->>Adapter: Completed 与 AuthResult
        Adapter-->>View: 命令调用完成
        Note over Adapter,View: 平台调度字段投影后展示业务结果并结束加载
        Note over Runtime,View: await 保证已接纳状态变化提交；UI 绘制独立调度
    else 操作被拒绝
        Runtime-->>Adapter: 调度 RejectedSnapshot 投影
        Adapter-->>View: 从快照展示验证反馈
        Runtime-->>Adapter: 调用结果 Rejected
        Note over Runtime,Runner: 未产生 SubmitEffect，Auth 服务未调用
    end
